For this example let’s download the digital elevation model data (DEM). The process is similar as before, we just provide the evalscript and create the request. More data on the DEM data collection is available 

here. DEM values are in meters and can be negative for areas which lie below sea level, so it is recommended to set the output format in your evalscript to FLOAT32.

evalscript_dem = '''
